                "text": "For Indian structural engineers, contractors, and project consultants managing busy sites around manufacturing hubs like Pithampur, Madhya Pradesh, understanding site handling discipline is critical. Because GFRP is approximately 4 times lighter than steel (~75% lighter), workers can easily maneuver bundles, but this lightness can sometimes lead to casual handling practices that ignore the risks posed by heavy site vehicles.",
